Hi Antonella,

Segment inclusion/exclusion is controlled by segmentWEARcrit.part5 <https://wadpac.github.io/GGIR/articles/GGIRParameters.html#segmentwearcrit-part5>
and segmentDAYSPTcrit.part5 <https://wadpac.github.io/GGIR/articles/GGIRParameters.html#segmentdaysptcrit-part5>, which help to make sure segment estimates are excluded pending segment overlap with sleep and/or non-wear time. See links for details.

Best,

