I think you forgot to specify qwindow_dateformat <https://wadpac.github.io/GGIR/articles/GGIRParameters.html#qwindow_dateformat>. Not specifying the date format correctly will make it impossible for GGIR to use the activity diary. GGIR should provide a warning when the date format is not recognised, please confirm.

If you do not want GGIR to use the activity log to run day segment analysis make sure the activity log file name has "onlyfilter" or "filteronly" in the filename as explained here <https://wadpac.github.io/GGIR/articles/GGIRParameters.html#nonwearfiltermaxhours>.

Best,

Vincent

